OL,14,     Fwith bad breath, thanks to its
OL,15,     Fpreferred all-you-can-eat buffet
OL,16,     Ffrom the dog poo bin. And Coco
OL,17,     Fgoes loco over inanimate objects
OL,18,     Fwhen out for walks.
